#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# bit_flip

#% text
# `bit_flip(k, i)` gives the integer `k` with bit `i` (0 the least significant) flipped.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
bit_flip(5, 1)
#% output
#= 7

#% cell
bit_flip(5, 2)
#% output
#= 1

#% cell
bit_flip([0, 1, 2, 3], 0)
#% output
#= [1, 0, 3, 2]

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `bit_xor`, `bit_length`
